# 🎯 STRATEGY — Forge-First

> **Authority**: CRD canon (caw:/.know/docs/local cloud produce zones.ail)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/forge-first.ail`

---

## S-FF-1 — Mệnh đề

> **CAW phát hiện lỗi. HACE sửa lỗi. Workspace đóng gói.**

Forge Layer (`ha:/`) là Source of Truth duy nhất. Mọi Cogninfer Actor
khi cần sửa source PHẢI quay về `ha:/engine/<domain>/<module>/`.

## S-FF-2 — Loop chuẩn

```text
1. IMPORT
   ha:/engine/*  (read-only)
        ↓
2. ASSEMBLE
   caw:/minispace/{ws}
        ↓
3. CHECK
   cargo check
        ↓
4. TEST
   scripts/ + tests/
        ↓
5. ERROR?
   ├── NO  → CRYSTALLIZE → caw artifact
   └── YES → DIAGNOSE
                  ↓
            FORGE patch / fix / refactor
                  ↓
            ha:/engine/*
                  ↓
            validate
                  ↓
            re-run caw
                  ↓
            PASS → PUSH
                  ↓
            gh:cosda-dev/*
            gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym
```

## S-FF-3 — Khi nào forge

| Trigger | Action | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Build fail tại caw:/ | Diagnose → Forge patch | Fixer |
| Test fail tại caw:/ | Diagnose → Forge patch | Fixer |
| API breaking change | Forge refactor | Producer + CTO approve |
| Dependency update | Forge Cargo.toml | Producer |
| Bug report | Forge fix | Fixer |
| Spec change | Forge spec → Forge impl | Producer (after CTO) |

## S-FF-4 — Khi nào KHÔNG forge

| Scenario | Why |
|---|---|
| Edit source từ caw:/ context | Forge SoT — caw read-only |
| Edit source từ ws:/ context | Forge SoT — ws read-only |
| Bypass C-X-R promotion | Cạnh tranh với constitution |
| Push unsealed lên gh:/ | Distribution audit fail |

## S-FF-5 — Output contract

Forge PHẢI output:

```yaml
artifact_output:
  - sealed_cap_path: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/c/artifact.<ext>"
  - changelog: "ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/CHANGELOG.md"
  - signed_by: "CSA / T3C-PRODUCER"
  - extension: [".wasm", ".so", ".dll", ".ae", ".amo", ".cap"]
  - sealed_hash: "<blake3>"
```

## S-FF-6 — Handoff to CAW

Sau khi forge xong:

```text
forge_output
   ↓
publish to gh:cosda-dev/* (mirror)
   ↓
caw:/minispace/{ws-*}/ refresh path-deps
   ↓
cargo check → cargo test → cargo build --release
   ↓
crystallize artifact
   ↓
copy to caw:/minispace/{ws-*}/release/
   ↓
Publisher push to gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release
```

